			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			id: "486BB8FBFE99A37A"
			rewards: [{
				auto: "enabled"
				command: "/execute as @p at @s run tellraw @p [{\"text\":\"As Ignis falls, his laughter echoes through the Nether: 'You think you've won, mortal? I was once the mightiest being in all eight realms. I wielded the power to shape worlds and crush the strongest foes. But then, the tide turned. New entities emerged, seeking to end my reign. They weakened me, forced me into hiding, and now they foolishly believe they are the protectors of the realms.'A sinister chuckle escapes him before he continues, 'Little do they know, their feeble attempts to guard this world only hasten its demise. You must act swiftly, for they are the true threat. They plan to shatter this reality and conquer it, just as they did millions of years ago. Only by defeating them can you save what remains. Take my weapons, you'll need them for your adventures. To obtain my armor, defeat all the guardians, only when you have killed them you will be mighty to wear my armor. \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"color\":\"yellow\"}]"
				id: "06CD1642272376F3"
